{
 "id": "https://deepbluecltd.github.io/barge-monitor/profile/v4.7",
 "title": "Canal barge weather display: declared profile, Version 4.7",
 "description": "The essential sources the display client needs (SRD FR-40, FR-40a), for every imported dataset, and the importer's catalogue and control stream. Published beside the server at profile.json (FR-41). An essential with scope 'dataset' is a template: '{dataset}' in its datastream stands for a dataset id, and the client checks each dataset against it when the dataset is opened; one missing makes that dataset degraded (FR-45). 'fixed' essentials are checked at the handshake. CO₂ is never essential (FR-40). There is no replay essential: replay is the display client's own (4.7).",
